== Description ==
The [[:Category:Tier_2_Pets|Tier 2]] version of {{PetTooltip|pet_name=Doppelganger}}. Available only to the {{ClassTooltip|class_name=Archon}} class. Bestows a lot of different bonuses, unlocking more as it reaches higher level.

Gains [[Experience#Pet Experience|experience]] each second based on [[Experience#Wizard_Experience|character experience]].

== Pet Abilities ==

On ability activation (every 1 second), grants 1 [[Sources|mana source]] whose cost must not exceed:
<br><math>10\,000 \times M</math>

From level 30, multiplies Shards Pool capacity by:
<br><math>P^{0.02} \times L^2 \times 100\,000 + 1</math>


From level 50, multiplies spell shards per click by:
<br><math>P^{0.2} \times L \times 0.25 + 1</math>


From level 75, autoclicks:
<br><math>P^{0.015} \times \frac{L-75}{25} + 1</math>
<br>times each second, with:
<br><math>\textbf{Click Profit}\ =\ \text{Hero Click Profit}</math>
<br><math>\textbf{Crit Chance}\ =\ \text{Hero Crit Chance}</math>
<br><math>\textbf{Crit Profit}\ =\ \text{Hero Crit Profit}</math>

From level 100, multiplies spell shards per second by:
<br><math>P^{0.2} \times L \times 0.5 + 1</math>

From level 125, multiplies profits by:
<br><math>P^{0.2} \times L^{0.5} \times C \times 0.01 + 1</math>

From level 150, multiplies Evocation efficiency by:
<br><math>P^{0.15} \times L^{0.5} \times S^{0.15} \times 0.1 + 1</math>

From level 175, multiplies Incantation efficiency by:
<br><math>P^{0.05} \times L \times 0.01 + 1</math>

From level 200, multiplies Mysteries power by:
<br><math>P^{0.1} \times L \times (D + 1) + 1</math>

From level 225, multiplies Void Profit by:
<br><math>P^{0.1} \times L \times 0.025 + 1</math>

From level 250, multiplies Void Entity lifetime by:
<br><math>P^{0.21} \times L \times 0.01 + 1</math>
<br>And Void Entity spawn rate by:
<br><math>P^{0.05} \times L \times 0.001 + 1</math>

From level 275, multiplies Character Ability Power by:
<br><math>P^{0.13} \times (L - 274) \times 0.05 + 1</math>

From level 300, multiplies Pet Ability Power by:
<br><math>\left( \log_{10}(Y) - 474 \right) \times (L - 290) \times 0.75 + 1</math>
<br>''Note: Grants no bonus below 1e475 Mysteries.''


From level 325, can evolve into {{PetTooltip|Psychic Cacophony}} if available.


where:
* <math>M = \text{All Mana this Realm}</math>
* <math>P = \text{Pet Ability Power}</math>
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level}</math>
* <math>C = \text{Character Level}</math>
* <math>S = \text{Spells Cast this Exile}</math>
* <math>D = \text{Enchanting Dust Collected this Exile}</math>
* <math>Y = \text{Current Amount of Mysteries}</math>

== Experience Gain ==

Accrues experience each second, equal to:
<br><math>\left(X^K \times 0.3 + F \right) \times M</math>

<!-- removed in v1.20.0a?
This is disbursed at a maximum rate per second, equal to:
<br><math>N_{L} \times 2</math>
-->

The XP needed for the next level is multiplied by 1.14 per level:
<br><math>N_{L} = 100 \times 1.14^{L-1}</math>
<br>''Note: This is lower than even T1 pets (1.16).''


where:
* <math>X = \text{Total Character Experience}</math>
* <math>K =\begin{cases}
0.05 + 0.1\times\left(\frac{\widetilde{C}}{100}\right)^3, &\text{if } \widetilde{C} < 300, \text{ and} \\
0.05 + 0.1\times 27 \times \left(\frac{\widetilde{C}}{100} - 2\right), &\text{else}.
\end{cases}</math>
* <math>F = \text{Fixed Pet XP Bonus}</math>
* <math>M = \text{Pet XP Multiplier}</math>
* <math>\widetilde{C} = \max\{101,\ \text{Character Level}\}</math>
* <math>N_{L} = \text{XP from Pet Level}\ (L-1)\ \text{to}\ L</math>
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level}</math>

